  "releaseNotes": "- **Added Font Awesome 4.7 icons to `FormattedText`**, displayed by linking the new `_content/TmEssentials.Razor/tm-essentials.css` stylesheet, which includes the font\n  - Added the `IconCssClass` parameter, `tm-icon` by default. Use `fa` with the Font Awesome 4.7 stylesheet, or `null` to not wrap the icons\n  - Added `FormattedText.DefaultIconCssClass`\n- Updated to TmEssentials 2.9.0, which formats text the same way as ManiaPlanet and only links safe URLs\n- Added .NET 11 support",
